    "status/status.json": "the client's own record \u2014 pairing, stages, packages, choices. An update edits exactly three things in it by hand: template_version, one appended notes line, and deleting keys named in remove_status_checklist_keys \u2014 nothing else, ever. The one script an update runs, node status/send.mjs migrate (since 1.5.0), writes scopes.send_risk: low when no level is recorded and touches nothing else in it",
