    ".claude/agents/ (everything but nothing \u2014 the whole directory)": "the client's hired team; the roster README carries their rows",
    ".claude/skills/ (any skill not in the refresh list)": "skills the client taught",
    ".update-backup/": "prior updates' safety copies",
    "anything not in the refresh or remove lists": "refresh may write its paths, remove may delete its paths \u2014 nothing else may be touched at all. The two lists are the whole permission"
